  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NDI Ukraine: Promoting Inclusion and Combating Discrimination - Promoting the Inclusion and combating discrimination</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">NDI Ukraine: Promoting Inclusion and Combating Discrimination</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsens &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka kapaciteten hos offentliga organisationer som har i uppgift att fr&#xe4;mja policymaking som beaktar genderaspekten; att &#xf6;ka f&#xf6;rst&#xe5;elsen f&#xf6;r f&#xf6;rdelarna med j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet p&#xe5; nationell niv&#xe5; samt att &#xf6;ka toleransen f&#xf6;r HBTQI-personer genom evidensbaserade informations- och advocacykampanjer.

Projektets huvudsakliga intressenter &#xe4;r J&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhetskontoret (Office for Gender Equality); Utskottet f&#xf6;r lika m&#xf6;jligheter (en plattform i parlamentet som &#xf6;ver partigr&#xe4;nserna verkar f&#xf6;r &#xf6;kad j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet); nationella ledare inom mediesektorn (redakt&#xf6;rer och beslutsfattare) samt civilsamh&#xe4;llesorganisationer som arbetar med j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet och HBTQI-personers r&#xe4;ttigheter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the intervention are to increase the capacity of key governmental bodies tasked with promoting gender-responsive approaches to policymaking; to incease public understanding of the benefits of gender equality at the national level; and to increase public tolerance of LGBTI people through evidence-based information and advovacy campaigns that prevent discrimination towards LGBTI people. 

The main stakeholders are the Office for Gender Equality (OGE); the Equal Opportunities Caucus (EOC a cross-party platform that seeks to advance gender equality); the Public Council on Gender (a platform made up of more than 100 national and local CSOs);  national media leaders (editors and decision makers) and LGBTI CSO&apos;s.</narrative>
  </description>
